 outputs

doc/p2mr-tripwire.md describes the experiment and where it comes from,
where leaf version 0xe0 executes, which outputs count as present, the
order of the checks once elliptic curve checks are disabled, the
activation on each network with -signetmldsa44 and -signettripwire,
the policy and the mempool around the height and the trigger,
gettripwireinfo and the logs, what a wallet should do, and the tests.
It says what the drill does not show.

doc/p2mr.md and doc/p2mr-mldsa44.md point to it, and the latter lists
-signetmldsa44 among the ways OP_CHECKMLDSA44 activates.
